t \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x)={sech}^{2}⁡x & \\,⇒\\,\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ({sech}^{2}⁡x-2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int (-2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-2\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x-2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186327953 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "273bab01-0930-5580-b073-8bafe7505887" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating the Square of the Hyperbolic Cosecant"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bd7537f3-2b2c-52ed-b56e-1d5396320393" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\operatorname{coth}⁡t+10t+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327955} {:answer/id #uuid "cda4b72b-52e8-55d4-b31a-50e3200b20c3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{coth}⁡t+10t+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327956} {:answer/id #uuid "56bf69ce-1c39-5c8f-85aa-8bdf354f8caf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{tanh}⁡t+10t+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327957} {:answer/id #uuid "5d702bf8-4e16-5f1d-8b8a-44e86d3d7732" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\operatorname{coth}⁡t+10+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327958} {:answer/id #uuid "3256a4ed-cb13-5e7a-8b1f-55c8dfbb6936" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{coth}⁡t+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327959}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cda4b72b-52e8-55d4-b31a-50e3200b20c3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{coth}⁡t+10t+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327956} :answer-field/id #uuid "741e3888-bdf6-5d08-bb00-40b1fef47e4f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327954}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "554462f4-0405-5db6-871a-3d348e81538a" :question/math-academy-id "q-96050" :question/problem "$\\int (3{csch}^{2}⁡t+10)\\,\\text{d}t=$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{coth}⁡t)=-{csch}^{2}⁡t\\,⇒\\,\\int {csch}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=-\\operatorname{coth}⁡t+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (3{csch}^{2}⁡t+10)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int 3{csch}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t+\\int 10\\,\\text{d}t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =3\\int {csch}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t+10\\int \\text{d}t \\\\  & =-3\\operatorname{coth}⁡t+10t+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186327960 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "273bab01-0930-5580-b073-8bafe7505887" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating the Square of the Hyperbolic Cosecant"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dc96eba7-4f04-5bf9-a449-03d504114358" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{tanh}⁡z+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327962} {:answer/id #uuid "fab2bfce-c7de-5772-8f39-82e6ea1afdf9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{coth}⁡z+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327963} {:answer/id #uuid "d3a21ab5-8d6b-5fd5-b159-a7c00dae388e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{coth}^{2}⁡z+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327964} {:answer/id #uuid "dab158ab-22ad-5d0f-8d05-9739b14c5734" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{coth}⁡z+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327965} {:answer/id #uuid "3fc52bc9-7dc4-501d-a00f-6a6696a088a4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{tanh}⁡z+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327966}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dab158ab-22ad-5d0f-8d05-9739b14c5734" :answer/ty